  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "10",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "HEB 10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "10",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa kukaia iyo Sharia eeka na kirerendi cheni cha vilambo viboie vichagha, wulalo ghwa fwana ya loli ya ivo vilambo, na jingi ndeidimagha kuwikatisha awo wandu wisoghodagha kwa Mlungu, kwa kufunya vizongona vija veni tulituli mwaka hata mwaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngera viadima-lee, kumangu sena ndevisighilo kufunywa? Kumangu waja watasi wereeleshwagha, ndewerewuyaasikira ngolo rawo rikiwitanya sena kwa wundu ghwa kaung'a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela kwa vizongona ivo, wandu wadakumbuka kaung'a mwaka kwa mwaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angu bagha ya njau na mburi, ndeidimagha kuinja kaung'a anduangi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa wundu ghwa agho, Kristo uendacha wurumwengunyi, oreghambieghe huwu,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na kula mkohani wadabonya wudumiki ghwake ituku ituku kalazi koni, ukifunya vizongona vija veni, ivo jingi visedimagha kuinja kaung'a.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.29.38"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kuf. 29.38",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela Kristo uendafunya kizongona chimweri cha ngelo rose kwa wundu ghwa kaung'a, oreserieghe kidombo chia ya mkonu ghwa kiwomi ghwa Mlungu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.110.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab. 110.1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na aho wawesera hata wamaiza wake wibonyo kukaia kifumbi chewikiria maghu ghake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angu kwa uko kukufunya indo jimweri, wawikatisha kwa kala na kala awo wieleshwagha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Roho Mweli wori wadishuhudia; angu nyuma ya kughora, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Iji nijo ilaghano nichaajibonya nawo",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kumsoghodera Mlungu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa huwu wanidu, deko na wuwana ghongia Andu kwa Wueli kwa bagha ya Jesu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "uo oredirughueghe chia mbishi, iko moyo, kwa kuidia pazienyi; kutambua kwaro, kuidia mumbinyi kwake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na kwa kukaia deko na mkohani m'baa wa nyumba ya Mlungu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ndedisoghode kaavui na Mlungu kwa ngolo ya loli, na irumirio jikate; dioghoshero ngolonyi disighe nia izamie na mimbi yedu ioghoshero kwa machi ghielie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.8.30"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wal. 8.30",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.36.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Eze. 36.25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndedimazire uko kurumiria kwa isuwirio jedu, disakenyavurika; angu uo ulaghirie ni mloli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nesi ndeditalane na kushashiriana diweni na diweni, kwa lukundo, na kubonya kazi ndicha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Disakesigha kuja kukwana chia imweri, seji wamu wibonyagha; ela dikumbane ngolo diweni na diweni, na kuchumba nandighi mkiwona seji ijo Ituku ja Bwana jakaia kaavui.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angu dikabonya kaung'a kidali nyuma ya kuimanya ija loli, ndechiko kizongona chingi chisighwagha kwa wundu ghwa kaung'a; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ela kuasighwa kulangaria kuja kutanywa koobosha, na kubia kwa modo, uko kuchaawilungura awo wamaiza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.26.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa. 26.11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mundu ukainona Sharia ya Musa, wadabwaghwa kuseko wughoma kwa wushuhuda ghwa wandu wawi angu wadadu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.17.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wuk. 17.6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.19.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "19.15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwamanya ni ikabo ibaa saki jichaamfwana mundu ummenyere Mwana wa Mlungu, ukaibonya bagha ya ilaghano kukaia kilambo cha kisha, iyo cheni oreelesheroghe nayo, sena wammenya Roho wa mvono?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.24.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kuf. 24.8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angu damwichi uo oreghorieghe, “Ngenga ni yapo, ini nichalipa.” Na sena “Bwana uchawitanya wandu wake.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.32.35+DEU.32.36"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wuk. 32.35-36",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni ilagho jeobosha kughwa mikonunyi kwa Mlungu uko moyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela kumbukenyi matuku gha kala; ngelo io, muendanekwa mwengere, morerumaghieghe kusimana kubaa kwa wasi mungi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngelo rimu mkisholelwa worinyi na kukorongwa, na ngelo rimu mkikaia ngara na awo werekoghe wikibonywa huwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angu morekoghe na wughoma na wafungwa, mkarumiria kusokwa mali renyu kwa kuboilwa; kwa kukaia inyo mmbeni moremanyireghe angu moko na mali riboie kuchumba, riduagha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa huwo msakeghusigha ugho wuwana ghonyu, angu ghoko na mafungu mabaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angu yakundikie mrumaghie, eri mpate kulubonya lukundo lwa Mlungu, na kupata icho mlaghirilo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
